{
  "tier": "builder",
  "rules": "1.4",
  "description": "Answers records to strings. Each vector builds one entry under the question flow, with words.json as the movement-word dataset, in the mode given (owner when none is). It expects the FXI (null for equipment on its own), the standard FXE, the full FXE when equipment build details were answered, and, beside an FXI, the provenance and gap marker the output record carries; or an error, for answers the flow does not accept. An error vector also gives fix, the one change (to answers, or to the entry) that makes the entry build, so it fails for that reason and no other. The strings must match byte for byte.",
  "words": "words.json",
